"""Night Shift API.

    uv run uvicorn api.server:app --port 8000

Routes: sandbox (Harbor demo, /api/*), product (/api/app/*, signed-in users), SDK (/v1/*, agent
tokens), Slack (/slack/*), internal (/api/internal/*, the web server after GitHub sign-in).
